d 'RTABLABS': module to label variables in a xsvmat dataset from a transposed r(table) matrix
d
d    rtablabs is intended for use in a xsvmat resultsset from a
d transposed  r(table) matrix saved by an estimation command.  It
d allocates variable labels to the numeric variables. 
d
d KW: label management
d
d Requires: Stata version 16 
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260909
d
d Author: Roger Newson,  King's College London
d Support: email roger.newson@@kcl.ac.uk
d
f rtablabs.sthlp
f rtablabs.ado
